{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDIzL1RoZSUyME5ldyUyMEJveSUyMCUyODIwMjMlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"The New Boy","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/r0hNRXZtGaON1wBPqPI4oe1V4CU.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4x2dOp6K4oG8Lwufd9qCFss0Yup.jpg","description":"In a remote monastery in 1940s Australia, a mission for Aboriginal children is run by a renegade nun, Sister Eileen. A new charge is delivered in the dead of night – a boy who appears to have special powers. When the monastery takes possession of a precious relic, a large carving of Christ on the cross, the new boy encounters Jesus for the first time and is transfixed. However, the boy’s Indigenous spiritual life does not gel with the mission’s Christianity and his mysterious power becomes a threat. Sister Eileen is faced with a choice between the traditions of her faith and the truth embodied in the boy, in this story of spiritual struggle and the cost of survival.\n\nRated 12A · Released 6 Jul 2023 · Australia, United Kingdom · Language: English · 116 min\nStudio: Dirty Films, Scarlett Pictures, Fremantle Australia\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2023","genres":["Drama","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.0","imdb_id":"tt18180926","moviedb_id":937161,"tmdbId":937161,"runtime":"116 min","cast":["Cate Blanchett","Deborah Mailman","Wayne Blair","Aswan Reid","Kenneth Radley","Shane Mckenzie Brady","Tyrique Brady","Laiken Woolmington"],"director":["Warwick Thornton"],"writer":["Warwick Thornton"],"released":"2023-07-06T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"A mysterious new arrival disturbs a delicately balanced world in this story of spiritual struggle and the cost of survival.","country":"Australia, United Kingdom","language":"English","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Warwick Thornton","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lbeXa9X4Pxf8FEy9ugXnspdMysG.jpg"},{"name":"Cate Blanchett","character":"Sister Eileen","photo":"h